            "review_title": "Review at Bombia - Bia Hơi Hà Nội",
            "review_text": "Phuong Linh N\nHanoi, Vietnam20 contributions\n0\nChill Evenings Near the Old Quarter\nSep 2025 • Friends\nA cozy beer restaurant with a lively yet laid-back feel, just minutes from Hanoi’s Old Quarter.\nFood: Creative Asian flavors mix with local classics, garlic black mayo fries and crispy mushrooms are good. They even give a hint of Chinese-style spice in the fried chicken.\nSpace: pub-style, cozy and friendly\nInsider tip:\nFresh beef salad with herbs + sweet & sour pickles = perfect start. Grilled meat and the fries with sauce sealed the deal for me.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 15, 2025",
